  "governing_obligation": "Every Inventory action surface shall derive truthfully labelled commands from accepted lifecycle state, immutable identity, dependencies, relationships, targets, proposals, and correction history rather than editable status labels; material and bulk commands shall revalidate authoritative state, expose impact and complete preflight outcomes, preserve each owning transaction contract, retain manual evidence-independent paths, keep proposals and exports separate from lifecycle acceptance, and ensure every valid nonterminal state offers a governed next action or actionable blocker while correction, replacement, resend, cancellation, archival, deletion, and history remain distinct workflows.",
